@page "/about"
<h1>About / Documentation</h1><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Purpose</h2><p>MindConnect is a course MVP that helps patients manage mental health support appointments with psychologists.</p><h2>Main features</h2><ul><li>Register, login, and logout using ASP.NET Core Identity.</li><li>Create, view, edit, cancel, delete, and review appointments.</li><li>View static psychologist availability cards.</li><li>Dashboard summaries for a fast demo.</li></ul><h2>How to use</h2><ol><li>Create an account or use the demo account.</li><li>Open Dashboard to review summaries.</li><li>Use Schedule Appointment to create an appointment.</li><li>Use My Appointments and History to manage records.</li></ol><h2>Technologies</h2><p>.NET 8, Blazor Server, EF Core, SQLite, ASP.NET Core Identity, and Bootstrap.</p><h2>Limitations and future improvements</h2><p>Future versions could add psychologist accounts, calendar integration, email reminders, and production hosting configuration.</p></div></div>
